WEBVTT

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.820
Thank you for all your hard
work this summer.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:17.630
I'd like to start this staff meeting,

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:20.110
but right now,
Uchiyamada-sensei is busy.

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:22.920
He is taking an urgent call.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:24.870
Did something happen?

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:27.730
It's Aizawa Miyabi's mother,
the president of the PTA.

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.530
It looks serious.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.330
Of course!

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:34.000
I'm not sure what happened,

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.800
<i>but Kotani-sensei suddenly said
she was going to cancel</i>

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.300
<i>the flower arranging course.</i>

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.900
<i>And Hakamada-sensei who
used to be so enthusiastic</i>

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.800
<i>about club activities has
ignored the clubs completely!</i>

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.100
<i>And then there's
Teshigawara-sensei, who left</i>

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:49.000
in the middle of his special
advanced class in such a state!

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.300
After that... continuing was
out of the question.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.600
The class that the head teacher
started as a replacement

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.470
was a disaster!

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:01.990
I told him not to do it.

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:04.390
It was too much out
of his expertise.

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:09.500
Wh-What did she say?

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.430
What did the PTA
president want?

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:14.730
For now, continue the meeting.

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:19.050
Well, now then...

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:25.100
This coming year, we are planing
to use new text books

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.250
starting from this fall.

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:30.700
I am carefully considering
the choices

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:32.800
from this list we compiled.

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:36.250
I will leave this up
to Nakamaru-sensei.

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:39.610
I'm sure no one has
any objections.

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:41.170
I understand.

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:44.850
Then I will take
responsibility for this.

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:47.180
- Excuse me...
- Yes?

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:50.220
Since we'll all be using these,

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:52.340
shouldn't we discuss this
a little more?

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:55.600
Well then, that is all
on the agenda for today.

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:57.600
Thank you for coming.

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:11.040
The PTA president said if
there are any more incidents,

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:13.850
she'd hold me responsible!

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:17.880
This principal's chair...

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:20.650
This is all Onizuka's fault!

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:23.270
I can't let him get away with this!

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:26.450
You just have to wait until
summer break is over, sir.

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:29.600
If class 2-4 doesn't end their
boycott by the start

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.200
of fall session,
then Onizuka will be fired.

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:35.030
That's right, isn't it?

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:38.230
Soon, that troll will disappear.

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:39.930
You're right!

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:45.150
Ah man, only two weeks
of summer left.

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:46.950
What are you so worried about?

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:49.800
Oh, I know, it must be one
of your students.

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:51.300
Are you having trouble again?

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.400
It's not that! You know,
summer is supposed

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:54.600
to be the season of love.

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:56.500
The way it's going,
this year's going end

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:59.100
- without anything happening.
- So you want some action?

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:00.400
What are you talking about?

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:02.200
What I'm talking about
is romance,

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.000
to make a wonderful
summer memory.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:06.500
Well, whatever, but you're not
getting any younger.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.330
You should do it soon.

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:12.900
Listen to yourself.
Don't you have any values?

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:15.210
You know, the tele-clubs
are the greatest!

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.510
When you meet a total babe,

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:19.910
you can go that same
day to a hotel.

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:21.810
On top of that, they're nineteen!

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:24.610
I think it was her first time...

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:28.320
I just want to share
the excitement with you.

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.090
I...

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:34.280
Hey now, listen,

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:37.690
I've decided that I will do it only
with the right woman!

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.190
Suit yourself.

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:41.960
Sorry, but I've got a date
tonight too.

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:44.800
Young girls are great you know,
such great bodies,

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:45.900
and so passionate!

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:49.000
Well, a virgin like you
wouldn't know.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.570
Ah, get out of here!

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:52.800
Well, you could go get
a compensated date

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:54.100
with a high school girl.

00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:02.750
He didn't touch his <i>sômen</i>...

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:25.190
Hello, this is Fuyutsuki.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:28.710
<i>Oh... this is Onizuka.</i>

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:32.480
- What happened?
- Uh...

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:34.800
Um, well...

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.580
I was wondering,

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.490
maybe you're free today?

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:42.890
- Why is that?
- Well, see...

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:44.720
Wanna go get something to eat?

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.720
You know, we never had my
welcoming party yet.

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:50.160
Gee, what should I do...

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:51.510
Please.

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:56.470
Oh, all right.

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:58.580
We haven't had your
welcoming party yet,

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:01.740
and you might be fired
by fall session, right?

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:16.120
- Such a nice ass, hmm?
- Huh?

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:18.300
- What <i>are</i> you doing.
- You see, I -

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.900
when I see someone walking
around dressed like that,

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:23.300
I become concerned it may be
one of our students.

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:25.600
Since they're free for summer,
I'm worried they

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:28.100
may get involved with
inappropriate relations.

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:31.040
You may talk big,
but your nose is growing.

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:32.740
No it's not.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:37.200
Do you think you can solve your
class' problems with an attitude

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:38.660
- like that?
- It'll be alright.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:39.900
I wonder.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:42.900
That time, just when Murai-kun
was about to tell you about

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:45.600
his secret, saying "When he's
ready to talk, he'll talk"

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:47.190
and trying to look so cool.

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:51.260
You know, it does no good
to force them to talk.

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:53.080
Maybe so,

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:56.800
but Murai Kunio and Aizawa
Miyabi started distrusting adults

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:59.080
after Murai-kun's good friend
was gone, right?

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:02.300
The key is to find out
about that, right?

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:05.680
I see.

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:09.180
- Do you know anything?
- Why ask me?

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:10.980
You were just saying...

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:14.540
The only thing I know,

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:19.320
two years ago, Murai-kun's
good friend dropped out.

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:22.940
After that, he died
in a motorcycle accident.

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:27.630
Since then, it seems that
subject has become taboo.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:31.820
I see.

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:33.900
Okay then, let's do this...

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:36.510
Let's find a quiet park,

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:39.810
- and carefully discuss this.
- What?!

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:42.110
Or how about a hotel lounge?

00:06:42.110 --> 00:06:45.410
Oh, but it might take until
morning, better get a room.

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:48.000
You know, just when I was
being serious...

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.300
Oh, wait!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.810
Fuyutsuki-sensei,
how about dinner?

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:53.790
You're unbelievable!

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:56.110
Because you lost a test
of courage,

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:58.010
you were about to tell them?

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:01.260
Murai, run!

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:15.730
Listen,

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.830
maybe...

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:22.000
- we can trust Onizuka.
- What are you saying?

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.730
Have you forgotten why
Takeshi died?

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:28.200
It was because he was betrayed
by his homeroom teacher.

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:31.230
I'll never forget.

00:07:31.230 --> 00:07:34.640
Why he died. About him.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:36.940
I'll never forget till the day I die.

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:42.370
I'm not going to be fooled
by Onizuka.

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:52.930
Will you wait, Fuyutsuki-sensei!

00:07:56.770 --> 00:07:59.250
Yo, Murai!

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:02.920
How's your mom?
Give her my best!

