00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:53.190
I love that!

00:09:54.430 --> 00:09:56.420
<i>Maybe...</i>

00:09:56.420 --> 00:09:58.730
<i>we can trust Onizuka.</i>

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.800
Oh man, I need money.

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:04.700
And we can't get jobs.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:07.880
It would have been great
born rich.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:10.080
My dad's just a salaryman.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:13.200
- His last bonus was pathetic!
- Mine too!

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:16.000
Miyabi, it's great that your
family is rich, isn't it?

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:18.280
What's up? You've been
out of it tonight.

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:21.280
Yeah, is there something
worrying you?

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:23.520
It's nothing.

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:26.000
I was just wondering if there
was something

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:28.290
- we could do to Onizuka.
- Forget him already!

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:30.300
He's going to be fired
come fall anyway.

00:10:30.300 --> 00:10:32.790
Right! As long as we
don't go to class.

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:37.790
You don't understand a thing,
that's why you say that!

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:46.700
What are you girls doing
out this late!

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:48.700
We're on our way home
from cram school.

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:51.800
- That's right!
- What's with those clothes!

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:54.600
It may be popular, but it's like
you're wearing underwear.

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:57.300
Don't you have any pride as
students of Seirin Academy?

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:00.480
You better not be doing any
compensated dating.

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:02.800
How rude! We would
never do that!

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:05.100
Then why are you loitering
around out here?

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.180
If you're so suspicious of us,

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:10.180
then you can give my
mother a call.

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:14.100
In any case, just because
it's summer

00:11:14.100 --> 00:11:15.600
doesn't mean you can slack off!

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:18.500
If you're not careful, you could
get into a major situation.

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:19.700
What's with Nakamaru?

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:22.200
Don't you think he's acting
even bigger than usual?

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:24.480
Hey, wait!

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:26.890
Who's that guy kissing up
to Nakamaru?

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:28.890
That is <i>so</i> pathetic!

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:31.260
I think I'd die if
I became like that!

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:38.720
- What's wrong?
- That's... my dad.

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:41.620
- No way!
- Why's he with Nakamaru?

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:45.260
He sells teaching materials
and text books.

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:50.380
Chikako.

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:54.060
Cheers!

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:58.700
So, you were a high school
student until this March?

00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:00.850
- That's right.
- That's not good!

00:12:00.850 --> 00:12:03.400
Then you're not much different
than my students!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:04.700
Sensei,

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.800
it's nice to come to a place
like this occasionally, isn't it?

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:10.000
It's been five years since you
separated

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:11.200
from your wife, hasn't it?

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:12.800
Raising a child takes so much.

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:15.700
That's right, so I have no time
to come to places like this.

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:18.920
Right? So let's live it up tonight!

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:20.150
Hey,

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:22.140
keep him company, now.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.590
Nakamaru-sensei,

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:33.250
I don't mean to be so persistent,

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:36.850
but please, please consider
our text books.

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:40.250
- Yes, I know.
- Then,

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:43.950
if we could discuss the content
in more detail...

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.450
Lighten up, sir!

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:48.670
By the way, I heard.

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:52.230
- Congratulations!
- Hey, what's that?

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:55.830
You're going to be head
teacher soon!

00:12:56.430 --> 00:12:57.430
Wow!

00:12:57.430 --> 00:13:00.630
Where did you hear that?
It's still unofficial!

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.420
It's only natural!

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:05.100
Because you've make such
a great contribution

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:07.730
- to the school.
- Oh, you can tell?

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:10.100
As Head Teacher Nakamaru,

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:12.800
please consider our texts
for Seirin Academy.

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:16.160
I wonder, what should we
do to tonight?

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:20.160
Leave that to us,
please feel free!

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:23.920
Um, this girl is okay for tonight.

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:26.120
No, I couldn't, I'm a teacher!

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:29.320
It's alright. This girl is very
tight lipped.

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:44.930
That's right,

00:13:44.930 --> 00:13:47.890
Nakamaru-sensei told us
at today's staff meeting,

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:51.090
they're going to purchase
new texts for this fall.

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:53.500
But you know, I wonder
if we really need to.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:56.190
I thought our current text's
were still fine.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:58.600
Can we stop talking about
things like that?

00:13:58.600 --> 00:13:59.730
You know,

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:01.630
we're finally alone together.

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:04.230
And today's my welcome
party, right?

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:06.900
Then what should we talk about?

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:09.020
How about things like love?

00:14:09.020 --> 00:14:11.400
Your just going to say let's go
to a hotel, right?

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:14.220
- You'd object to that?
- There you go again!

00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:18.410
I told you before!

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:21.000
I've decided that my first time
will be only with

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.000
the woman I love!

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:27.460
And so...

00:14:28.190 --> 00:14:30.290
What are you trying to say?

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:32.780
You see, I...

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:39.010
- See, I...
- Eikichi?

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:46.740
What are you doing here?

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:50.730
You're being so cold!
You never call!

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:54.200
- Oh...
- Who is this?

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:57.040
Oh, uh, nobody special...

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:59.240
I should ask who you are?

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:00.840
What are you to my Eikichi?

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:04.440
Hey, cut it out!
Don't talk like that!

00:15:04.440 --> 00:15:07.210
Please don't worry,
I'm just a coworker.

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:09.310
I was just about to leave.

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:12.410
Hey, wait! Fuyutsuki-sensei!

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:15.010
Bye then... Eikichi!

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:24.690
Man, this pisses me off already!

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:27.300
I don't want to see my pathetic
dad already.

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:31.440
Hey Miyabi, is there something
cool we can do?

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:34.690
- How about a club?
- Oh, but I don't have money.

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:36.100
Me too.

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:37.300
Why don't we do some

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:39.000
- compensated dating.
- What?!

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.290
You said you wanted
money, right?

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:44.670
Then that's the easiest way.

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:46.400
Adults are so stupid.

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:49.000
Just flash them panties
and they'll give you money.

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:51.110
- Are you serious, Miyabi?
- That's crazy!

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:52.290
Silly,

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:54.810
once you get what you want,
just run away.

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:56.100
What?

00:15:57.860 --> 00:16:00.300
I'm a seventeen-year-old
high school girl

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:01.450
who loves a good time.

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:05.630
I'm looking for a message
from a wonderful rich man.

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:08.030
I'm waiting!

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:15.620
Oh geeze, just a minute more...

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.250
What are you grumbling about?

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:18.550
Here.

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:22.050
You're sure your parents
aren't coming home?

00:16:22.050 --> 00:16:24.800
Yeah. The Benz just came back
from the shop,

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:26.400
so they went to a <i>onsen</i>.

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:28.650
Why was it in the shop?

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:32.900
He left it at school
and someone trashed it.

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:35.650
Really? I guess there are evil
people in this world.

00:16:37.630 --> 00:16:39.030
Kiss me!

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:43.520
- Please! Hey, hey!
- Hold on...

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.520
- We're home.
- Oh no, they're back!

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:49.420
- No way!
- Yoshiko, are you home?

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:54.220
Wait! We haven't done
anything wrong!

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:56.300
I'll introduce you to my dad
and mom.

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:58.800
- Don't be ridiculous!
- Wait!

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:02.470
- Who was that?
- Hm?

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:05.350
- Who was that just now?
- Who?

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:08.180
Don't play innocent,
they ran away just now!

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:11.580
Did you bring a boy in here
while we were gone?

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:13.780
Why'd you come back so early?

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:16.900
Well you see,
the <i>ryokan</i> was a disaster.

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:19.000
The food was terrible
and the baths dirty,

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:20.700
I don't know what dad
was thinking.

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:22.600
Well it was through
an introduction

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:23.900
of one of the school staff.

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:27.230
Never mind that!
Who was that that ran away?

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:29.800
It wasn't...

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:31.750
that guy Eikichi?

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:34.650
Oh! Why didn't you
introduce him?

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:36.240
That's what I told him.

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:38.200
I'll never approve
of the likes of him!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:39.800
Never mind, Dad,
it doesn't matter.

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:41.340
Hold on Yoshiko!

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:47.940
That guy... Do you know
his last name?

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:50.510
Yes, I asked the other day.

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:53.400
Why didn't you tell me earlier!

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:56.000
So what is his name?

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.480
I forgot.

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:02.200
How can you forget something
so important!

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:03.200
Give me a break!

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:06.410
If you want to know so badly,
find out for yourself!

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:08.500
I'm pooped!

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:10.420
I'm going to take a bath.

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:20.530
- Hey, hurry up.
- I'll be right there.

00:18:47.670 --> 00:18:50.990
- How'd it go?
- Perfect!

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:52.510
Me too!

00:18:52.510 --> 00:18:56.270
They're so stupid,
it was so easy!

00:18:58.410 --> 00:19:00.200
What about Chikako?

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:02.600
When it came to the moment,
she chickened out.

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:06.210
- Your kidding!
- Miyabi, I can't...

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:07.910
Have you forgotten our pact?

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:10.810
We made a vow to stick together
through anything, right?

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:20.300
I told you should just let
yourself loose.

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:23.400
Idiot! I told you I'm not going
to a prostitute the first time.

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:25.250
- Let's go.
- Stupid!

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:27.450
Tele-clubs aren't prostitution.

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:29.560
It like a dating service!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:32.760
You don't know that?
That's why you never get any!

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:34.660
Me?

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:36.960
I'm a scout for a record
company.

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:41.550
Oh yeah! Komuro is like family
to me already!

00:19:42.590 --> 00:19:45.080
What are you doing? Hurry up!

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:47.210
Make sure and read that.

00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:50.000
Hello? Sorry about that.

00:19:51.610 --> 00:19:54.210
Gee, is this for real?

00:19:57.370 --> 00:20:00.160
- Hello?
<i>- Hello.</i>

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:02.690
<i>I'm a high school student.</i>

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:06.830
- What do you do?
- Me?

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:11.630
Well, I write scenarios
for dramas.

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:14.120
No way!
What have you written?

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:17.620
Let's see... Like <i>Long Vacation</i>,

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:20.820
and <i>Love... Love Gen...
Love Generation</i>.

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:24.240
<i>No way! I loved both
those shows!</i>

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:25.750
Oh, great.

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:29.850
Why the heck am I lying?

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:34.950
But you know, wasn't the writer
a woman for both those shows?

00:20:34.950 --> 00:20:36.650
Oh, um, well...

00:20:36.650 --> 00:20:39.170
That's a pen name!
You know, a pen name!

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:42.910
Wow! Then you get to meet
a lot of famous people?

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:44.620
Yeah, well it's part of my work.

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:47.420
Wow! So who have you met?

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:48.920
Yes, well...

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:59.260
Hey, why don't we get together?

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:02.600
Will you give me money?

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:07.270
If you give me money,
I'll meet you.

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:09.430
How much?

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:14.180
Hey! Over here!

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:18.250
Isn't 100,000 a bit much?

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:21.350
- Just hand it over!
- You better pay it back!

00:21:21.350 --> 00:21:23.150
I've got it rough too, you know.

00:21:23.150 --> 00:21:26.150
- Okay. See ya!
- Sheeze, did he hear me?

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:53.100
What are you doing? Let me go!

00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:55.000
I see, so this
is compensated dater.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:56.200
What about you?

00:21:56.200 --> 00:21:58.510
You're a teacher
and you used a tele-club!

00:21:58.510 --> 00:22:01.310
You got no right talking like that!

00:22:01.310 --> 00:22:03.700
Besides, what's wrong
with compensated dates?

00:22:03.700 --> 00:22:06.710
It makes the guy happy,
and we get money.

00:22:06.710 --> 00:22:08.220
It doesn't bother anyone!

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:10.520
You're right.
You're absolutely right.

00:22:15.590 --> 00:22:17.100
You serious?

00:22:19.800 --> 00:22:22.200
Wow! So this is what one
of these hotel's is like?

00:22:22.200 --> 00:22:25.370
Hey! There's even karaoke!

00:22:34.580 --> 00:22:36.700
Hurry and get undressed.

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:40.200
Chikako, I've got one request.

00:22:40.200 --> 00:22:41.800
What is it?

00:22:42.200 --> 00:22:44.500
Before you get undressed,
put on loose socks.

00:22:44.500 --> 00:22:45.500
What?

00:22:45.500 --> 00:22:49.620
You know, our school doesn't
have loose socks, right?

00:22:49.620 --> 00:22:50.700
Stop messing around.

00:22:50.700 --> 00:22:52.900
Why doesn't you hurry
and take a shower.

00:22:54.400 --> 00:22:56.520
You're going
to run away then, right?

00:23:22.490 --> 00:23:24.100
You know...

00:23:25.690 --> 00:23:29.690
When I do it, I really want
to do it with the woman I love.

00:23:34.920 --> 00:23:36.400
Listen, Chikako.

00:23:36.400 --> 00:23:40.300
If you do this, you'll come
to hate sex.

00:23:46.530 --> 00:23:50.700
If you do it for money, then it
means you enjoy money

00:23:50.700 --> 00:23:52.110
more than sex, right?

00:23:52.110 --> 00:23:54.200
That would be terrible.

00:23:59.200 --> 00:24:01.630
When you do it with
the person you really love,

00:24:01.630 --> 00:24:03.780
it's the greatest
feeling you can have.

00:24:16.480 --> 00:24:19.300
- Is this alright?
- Sure.

00:24:19.300 --> 00:24:22.990
- Just pay up.
- I know!

00:24:27.980 --> 00:24:30.150
- Hide!
- Why?

00:24:30.150 --> 00:24:31.350
Just do it!

00:25:05.040 --> 00:25:07.390
Let's see, Onizuka...

00:25:11.930 --> 00:25:14.230
What am I worrying about?

00:25:16.040 --> 00:25:18.940
She's my daughter.

00:25:18.940 --> 00:25:21.700
There's no way she could be
fooled by a man like him.

00:25:44.370 --> 00:25:46.070
I've done it, sir!

00:25:46.070 --> 00:25:48.970
I've caught that Onizuka
red handed!

00:25:49.400 --> 00:25:51.700
This will be the end of him!

00:25:52.400 --> 00:25:54.900
You'll become principle for sure!

00:25:57.970 --> 00:26:00.240
Nakamaru-sensei...

00:26:00.240 --> 00:26:02.070
I'm counting on you.

00:26:04.400 --> 00:26:07.970
Sir? Hello? Hello?

00:26:14.550 --> 00:26:17.450
Looks like I can't count
on the head teacher either!

00:26:30.500 --> 00:26:33.700
Looks like it's up to me
to save our academy.

00:26:40.900 --> 00:26:42.900
TO MIYABI

00:26:44.500 --> 00:26:46.400
TAKESHI

00:27:19.190 --> 00:27:22.390
- Hello?
<i>- Miyabi, I'm in trouble!</i>

00:27:22.390 --> 00:27:23.390
What happened?

00:27:23.390 --> 00:27:26.390
Nakamaru saw us leaving
the hotel.

00:27:26.390 --> 00:27:28.590
He told me to come to school
tomorrow.

00:27:28.590 --> 00:27:29.690
Seriously?

00:27:29.690 --> 00:27:32.250
I'm going to be expelled
for sure!

00:27:33.080 --> 00:27:35.680
- I'm home.
- Hold on.

00:27:43.510 --> 00:27:46.810
Why don't you figure something
out with the guy and fool them?

00:27:46.810 --> 00:27:49.230
But the other guy...

00:27:50.550 --> 00:27:53.870
- it's Onizuka.
- Onizuka?!

00:27:53.870 --> 00:27:56.170
<i>What should I do, Miyabi?</i>

00:27:59.950 --> 00:28:02.750
- I got a great idea.
- What is it?

00:28:06.470 --> 00:28:09.870
Looks like the final straw,
Onizuka-sensei.

00:28:09.870 --> 00:28:12.200
For a teacher to engage
in adulterous acts

00:28:12.200 --> 00:28:14.700
with his student, what do you
think you're doing!

00:28:14.700 --> 00:28:16.960
We didn't do anything improper!

00:28:16.960 --> 00:28:19.710
- Right, Chikako?
- Don't play innocent.

00:28:20.050 --> 00:28:21.950
I saw it with my own eyes!

00:28:21.950 --> 00:28:25.550
I saw you two leaving
the love hotel.

00:28:28.810 --> 00:28:31.810
Nakamaru-sensei,
why where you there too?

00:28:33.680 --> 00:28:37.000
Yes, well, I just had someone
visiting and was showing

00:28:37.000 --> 00:28:38.400
them around town.

00:28:39.850 --> 00:28:43.250
Th-That's why
I discovered you two!

00:28:43.250 --> 00:28:45.250
That was a extracurricular
lesson.

00:28:45.250 --> 00:28:46.300
What's that?

00:28:46.300 --> 00:28:49.100
I took her to a love hotel
to show her

00:28:49.100 --> 00:28:50.730
the difference in love.

00:28:50.730 --> 00:28:53.850
No one's ever going to believe
something so ridiculous!

00:28:54.590 --> 00:28:57.400
Chikako, say something.

00:28:57.400 --> 00:29:00.610
Go on, is there something you
want to say?

00:29:01.710 --> 00:29:03.110
I...

00:29:05.480 --> 00:29:07.080
Come on, Chikako.

00:29:07.080 --> 00:29:10.180
We didn't do anything,
so just go ahead and tell him.

00:29:10.980 --> 00:29:14.080
I... Onizuka-sensei...

00:29:16.360 --> 00:29:19.160
Onizuka-sensei forced
himself on me!

00:29:20.100 --> 00:29:22.010
What was that!?

00:29:28.450 --> 00:29:30.350
That was great, Miyabi!

00:29:30.350 --> 00:29:32.450
Now Onizuka'll be fired for sure!

00:29:32.450 --> 00:29:34.190
Yeah, well.

00:29:34.190 --> 00:29:37.700
Man, I wish I could have
seen his face!

00:29:39.730 --> 00:29:41.030
What's wrong?

00:29:41.900 --> 00:29:43.500
You know, Onizuka...

00:29:43.500 --> 00:29:45.800
- He didn't react at all.
- What?

00:29:45.800 --> 00:29:47.410
No matter what I said,

00:29:47.410 --> 00:29:49.210
he just stood there and listened.

00:29:49.210 --> 00:29:51.060
He just gave up.

00:29:51.060 --> 00:29:52.880
He knew he couldn't
make excuses.

00:29:52.880 --> 00:29:54.750
Maybe.

00:29:54.750 --> 00:29:58.880
Could you be feeling guilty?

00:29:58.880 --> 00:30:00.080
No, but...

00:30:00.080 --> 00:30:02.980
Or maybe you really did
do it with Onizuka.

00:30:02.980 --> 00:30:06.180
- What are you saying!
- You wanted money, didn't you?

00:30:06.710 --> 00:30:08.800
You probably got caught up
by Onizuka.

00:30:08.800 --> 00:30:10.710
Miyabi, how can you say that!

00:30:10.710 --> 00:30:13.350
- That's terrible, Miyabi!
- Don't you talk back to me!

00:30:13.350 --> 00:30:16.200
When we go to concerts,
or go out to eat,

00:30:16.200 --> 00:30:17.580
it's always my treat.

00:30:17.580 --> 00:30:21.200
And when we have tests,
if I never showed you

00:30:21.200 --> 00:30:23.030
my answers, you'd never pass.

00:30:23.030 --> 00:30:25.800
And this time too.
If I didn't rescue you,

00:30:25.800 --> 00:30:27.910
you'd have been expelled,
you know.

00:30:27.910 --> 00:30:30.020
Or would you rather
have had that?

00:30:32.570 --> 00:30:35.120
Chikako, wait! Chikako!

00:30:35.120 --> 00:30:37.200
You can't do anything
for yourselves.

00:30:37.200 --> 00:30:39.520
Don't go talking big.

00:30:59.180 --> 00:31:00.480
Yes?

00:31:01.910 --> 00:31:03.300
Oh, Fuyutsuki-sensei!

00:31:03.300 --> 00:31:05.200
Could you hold on a minute,
it's a mess.

00:31:05.200 --> 00:31:07.940
- Right here is fine.
- Huh?

00:31:07.940 --> 00:31:11.700
- Why the scary face?
- What do you expect!

00:31:11.700 --> 00:31:13.100
Causing such a problem!

00:31:13.100 --> 00:31:15.900
Not to worry,
I haven't done a thing.

00:31:16.550 --> 00:31:20.200
Do you think I can believe such
a habitual prankster?

00:31:20.720 --> 00:31:23.800
Like last time, you had that girl
fawning over you

00:31:23.800 --> 00:31:25.100
calling you Eikichi.

00:31:25.100 --> 00:31:27.910
How can you expect me to trust
a person like that?

00:31:27.910 --> 00:31:31.210
Uh, well, hold on a minute.

00:31:38.640 --> 00:31:40.040
I haven't used it yet.

00:31:42.800 --> 00:31:44.600
Not good enough?

00:31:46.740 --> 00:31:48.040
Then...

00:31:48.400 --> 00:31:50.200
Why don't you say anything?

00:31:51.040 --> 00:31:53.450
Why don't you defend your
innocence?

00:31:53.450 --> 00:31:55.840
Ôshima Chikako's lying, right?

00:31:55.840 --> 00:31:59.040
Those who lie will eventually
tell the truth.

00:31:59.940 --> 00:32:04.000
Besides, I believe in her.

00:32:08.710 --> 00:32:10.510
Hello, this is the Ôshima's.

00:32:11.030 --> 00:32:13.230
Oh, Nakamaru-sensei!

00:32:13.230 --> 00:32:15.230
Thank you for the other day!

00:32:17.950 --> 00:32:19.750
Thank you very much!

00:32:20.350 --> 00:32:25.150
I will deliver the text's to your
school tomorrow.

00:32:27.930 --> 00:32:31.130
<i>It's about a gratuity...</i>

00:32:31.130 --> 00:32:32.630
<i>Oh yes.</i>

00:32:32.630 --> 00:32:36.830
I am certainly grateful
for your business.

00:32:36.830 --> 00:32:38.530
That's not what I mean.

00:32:39.360 --> 00:32:40.560
You know...

00:32:40.560 --> 00:32:44.760
I have a hard time with expenses
like the loan on my condo.

00:32:45.650 --> 00:32:50.650
That's why I gave you my
account number.

00:32:51.180 --> 00:32:54.610
- He's taking a kickback!
- But...

00:32:55.010 --> 00:32:57.210
I can't...

00:32:57.210 --> 00:33:00.080
That's alright if it's too
much for you.

00:33:00.080 --> 00:33:02.610
I can always switch to another
company.

00:33:04.480 --> 00:33:06.320
I understand.

00:33:06.320 --> 00:33:12.260
I'll increase the amount
on the bill.

00:33:12.260 --> 00:33:18.100
Then when I receive the payment,
I will transfer

00:33:18.100 --> 00:33:21.090
the difference into your account.

00:33:21.090 --> 00:33:25.910
Well then, if you'll excuse me.

00:34:20.180 --> 00:34:22.630
Hey! What's up?

00:34:30.700 --> 00:34:34.960
Excuse me, what is this
emergency staff meeting for?

00:34:34.960 --> 00:34:37.680
Looks like this time Onizuka-
sensei's really fired.

00:34:37.680 --> 00:34:38.800
Really?

00:34:38.800 --> 00:34:40.900
Yes, I couldn't believe it either.

00:34:40.900 --> 00:34:43.700
It's Nakamaru-sensei who
brought this to our attention.

00:34:43.700 --> 00:34:46.680
Yes, it seems the head teacher
hasn't been around recently.

00:34:46.680 --> 00:34:48.600
I wonder if Onizuka did
something

00:34:48.600 --> 00:34:51.120
- to the head teacher too.
- The head teacher too?

00:34:51.120 --> 00:34:53.700
Did Onizuka do something
damaging to you too,

00:34:53.700 --> 00:34:56.540
- Hakamada-sensei?
- Not you too, Kotani-sensei?

00:34:56.540 --> 00:34:58.240
N-No, not really!

00:34:58.240 --> 00:35:00.100
What about you,
Teshigawara-sensei?

00:35:00.100 --> 00:35:04.140
- Oh well, no, I...
- Good morning.

00:35:17.000 --> 00:35:19.200
Now, everyone.

00:35:20.380 --> 00:35:24.180
The reason for today's
emergency meeting

00:35:25.240 --> 00:35:27.040
is regarding Onizuka-sensei.

00:35:27.040 --> 00:35:29.740
He attacked one of his
homeroom students.

00:35:30.480 --> 00:35:34.880
This time's an major incident that
cannot be explained away.

00:35:35.250 --> 00:35:37.150
If this leaked out to the media,

00:35:37.150 --> 00:35:41.150
the status and future of this
academy will certainly be finished.

00:35:41.150 --> 00:35:43.100
Nakamaru-sensei is really
into this.

00:35:43.100 --> 00:35:44.900
He thinks he's head teacher
already.

00:35:44.900 --> 00:35:47.990
No matter how much
the director covers for him,

00:35:47.990 --> 00:35:50.900
I will never forgive that totally
unqualified

00:35:50.900 --> 00:35:52.300
to be a teacher of a man.

00:35:53.200 --> 00:35:58.960
Today, without question,
I will have Onizuka-sensei quit.

00:36:08.240 --> 00:36:09.600
Thank you!

00:36:09.600 --> 00:36:11.800
- Let me give you a hand.
- Oh...

00:36:11.800 --> 00:36:13.100
Thanks!

00:36:15.200 --> 00:36:17.200
MEIKEN SHOSEKI

00:36:17.600 --> 00:36:20.500
In other business,
concerning the texts we will

00:36:20.500 --> 00:36:21.970
begin using this fall...

00:36:21.970 --> 00:36:25.160
I have studied the offerings
carefully.

00:36:25.160 --> 00:36:28.760
I have found a source we can
trust completely.

00:36:28.760 --> 00:36:31.010
- What are you doing?
- Stop it!

00:36:31.010 --> 00:36:32.720
Please hold on.

00:36:35.760 --> 00:36:38.570
Stop it! What are you doing?

00:36:38.570 --> 00:36:41.720
- Please stop!
- What is he up to?

00:36:42.240 --> 00:36:43.620
Stop it!

00:36:51.570 --> 00:36:54.800
Please stop it! I'll call the police!

00:36:56.150 --> 00:36:59.440
Please stop!
Will you please stop!

00:36:59.440 --> 00:37:00.690
Stop it!

00:37:01.730 --> 00:37:03.230
Please stop!

00:37:07.580 --> 00:37:09.180
Who are you?

00:37:12.460 --> 00:37:15.300
I'm your daughter's homeroom
teacher, Onizuka Eikichi.

00:37:21.050 --> 00:37:22.550
Chikako...

00:37:32.550 --> 00:37:33.950
What are you doing?

00:37:38.200 --> 00:37:41.110
Stop it! Wait, please!

00:37:44.860 --> 00:37:46.360
No, you're not...

00:37:58.260 --> 00:37:59.760
How could you...

00:38:11.000 --> 00:38:13.400
Do you realize what you
are doing, Onizuka?

00:38:13.400 --> 00:38:16.400
You'll be fired, if you do this,
you'll be fired immediately!

00:38:16.400 --> 00:38:18.720
There's no way you can
weasel out of this!

00:38:24.720 --> 00:38:26.870
What... What's that?

00:38:28.680 --> 00:38:31.180
Chikako, you didn't...

00:38:31.180 --> 00:38:32.890
It's because you did this!

00:38:33.900 --> 00:38:36.310
What's the meaning of this,
Ôshima-san?

00:38:48.840 --> 00:38:52.340
I didn't want to do this either.

00:38:52.850 --> 00:38:54.250
Not this...

00:38:54.930 --> 00:38:58.330
But, but with this recession,

00:39:00.330 --> 00:39:02.910
sales figures haven't risen.

00:39:02.910 --> 00:39:05.330
If I don't show results,

00:39:05.330 --> 00:39:07.030
I'll be restructured.

00:39:07.610 --> 00:39:09.410
So I didn't have a choice.

00:39:11.260 --> 00:39:13.100
You see, all this...

00:39:13.100 --> 00:39:15.320
It was because I felt I had
to do it for you.

00:39:15.320 --> 00:39:17.520
Don't try to make it
for our good.

00:39:18.130 --> 00:39:19.900
Don't say it was for our family!

00:39:19.900 --> 00:39:22.270
Don't make it an excuse!

00:39:26.320 --> 00:39:27.620
Chikako,

00:39:28.520 --> 00:39:30.020
don't get carried away.

00:39:36.170 --> 00:39:38.770
You may be saying how
dirty adults are,

00:39:39.170 --> 00:39:40.700
but take a look at yourself.

00:39:40.700 --> 00:39:43.300
If you continue, you'll become
a dirty adult too.

00:41:22.190 --> 00:41:23.790
Hold it!

00:41:24.180 --> 00:41:26.180
Is this okay?

00:41:26.180 --> 00:41:28.180
Sir, get a grip!

00:41:28.180 --> 00:41:30.180
Why are you just standing there?

00:42:06.370 --> 00:42:08.400
I figured it would turn
out like this.

00:42:08.400 --> 00:42:11.770
It was too much
for Nakamaru-sensei.

00:42:11.770 --> 00:42:15.070
He doesn't understand
a thing about Onizuka.

00:42:28.950 --> 00:42:34.720
About the new texts, it's been
taken care of already, right?

00:42:34.720 --> 00:42:39.100
Yes, well, there were
many mistakes...

00:42:39.100 --> 00:42:41.420
I would like to look into it further.

00:42:41.850 --> 00:42:45.050
Oh? I see.

00:42:46.460 --> 00:42:48.910
- If you'll excuse me...
- Okay.

00:42:48.910 --> 00:42:52.080
- Nakamaru-sensei.
- Yes?

00:42:52.080 --> 00:42:55.500
Wasn't there something
regarding Onizuka-sensei

00:42:55.500 --> 00:42:57.900
that you wanted to discuss
with me?

00:42:59.570 --> 00:43:02.170
That's also still being
investigated.

00:43:02.170 --> 00:43:04.570
Oh. I see.

00:43:04.570 --> 00:43:06.170
Excuse me.

00:43:07.580 --> 00:43:09.080
Nakamaru-sensei.

00:43:09.870 --> 00:43:12.860
- Yes?
- Then...

00:43:12.860 --> 00:43:16.370
Just now, were you
baking <i>yakiimo</i>?

00:43:23.950 --> 00:43:25.850
Did you seriously tell them?

00:43:27.130 --> 00:43:28.900
If you just kept your
mouths shut,

00:43:28.900 --> 00:43:31.100
then it would have been
all his fault

00:43:31.100 --> 00:43:32.750
and he would have been fired.

00:43:32.750 --> 00:43:36.550
- So why did you tell the truth?
- We were the ones at fault!

00:43:36.550 --> 00:43:38.860
- We had to apologize.
- Are you stupid?

00:43:38.860 --> 00:43:40.850
Don't you care if you're
expelled?

00:43:40.850 --> 00:43:42.850
We didn't want to become
dirty adults.

00:43:44.190 --> 00:43:45.490
Both of us.

00:43:48.980 --> 00:43:51.670
Don't worry, we won't
snitch about you.

00:43:51.880 --> 00:43:53.300
But in return,

00:43:53.300 --> 00:43:56.180
we're not going to associate
with the likes of you.

00:44:00.230 --> 00:44:02.530
You think that's going
to solve everything?

00:44:05.780 --> 00:44:07.980
Don't blame me if you regret it!

00:44:23.700 --> 00:44:26.400
MUSASHINO SEIRIN  ACADEMY

00:44:27.300 --> 00:44:29.700
Thanks for telling the truth,
you're great!

00:44:31.050 --> 00:44:34.050
Don't worry about a thing,
you won't be expelled.

00:44:34.050 --> 00:44:35.450
Really?

00:44:36.100 --> 00:44:38.110
Trust your homeroom teacher!

00:44:39.440 --> 00:44:41.240
Excuse us!

00:44:41.980 --> 00:44:43.480
Sweet dreams!

00:44:44.670 --> 00:44:47.600
- Is it okay to tell them that?
- Why's that?

00:44:47.600 --> 00:44:50.300
This is going to be reported
to the head teacher, right?

00:44:50.300 --> 00:44:52.170
It's possible they might
be expelled.

00:44:52.170 --> 00:44:54.470
No way! When it comes to that,
I'll protect them!

00:44:55.600 --> 00:44:57.440
Oh, hello Head Teacher!

00:44:57.440 --> 00:44:59.270
You...

00:44:59.270 --> 00:45:01.100
Did you think I would
ever approve?

00:45:01.100 --> 00:45:04.700
- What's up with him?
- I'll get you out of here.

00:45:04.700 --> 00:45:07.210
From this academy, no!

00:45:07.210 --> 00:45:09.290
This town, no!

00:45:09.290 --> 00:45:11.480
From the entire
educational system!

00:45:11.950 --> 00:45:13.550
Did something happen?

00:45:14.500 --> 00:45:18.230
- Oh, yes, yes, yes, I understand.
- President!

00:45:18.230 --> 00:45:20.470
I'll discuss this with you
later then.

00:45:27.380 --> 00:45:29.980
So you are Onizuka-sensei?

00:45:32.520 --> 00:45:33.700
Who're you?

00:45:33.700 --> 00:45:36.600
She's Aizawa Miyabi's mother,
the President of the PTA.

00:45:36.600 --> 00:45:40.400
So, you're the one responsible
for getting my daughter

00:45:40.400 --> 00:45:42.400
into so many bad situations?

00:45:44.800 --> 00:45:47.600
I won't let you get away
with this now!

00:45:47.600 --> 00:45:49.200
2016-05

